    #!/usr/bin/env bash
    # Milestone 2 part 1 P1 negative.log (specs/0016-new-workbook-and-sheets.md,
    # "P1: the carried items and the Excel check 2 list", with "Planning rulings
    # during P1 (2026-09-24)" 1 to 4 and 11). Two families, every fixture
